Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.98,0:00:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I carry high my craven flag,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.56,0:00:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,my ally I'm gonna fly and let my\Nstruggles shoot me through the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.36,0:00:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be a pity if we\Nlingered here and let our
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.08,0:00:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,pretty sparks of life\Nblend aloud and disappear?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.14,0:00:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There may be fog that even you can't\Nnavigate If someone strong like you is lost,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.54,0:00:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,then who will set me straight?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.92,0:00:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause when the waves cast my heart adrift.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.92,0:00:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been your kindness and your strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.82,0:00:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That would free me from the mist.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.10,0:00:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.80,0:00:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.44,0:00:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sail to a new dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.54,0:00:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Weigh anchor right as high as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.38,0:00:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I assure I don't need anger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.52,0:00:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I go fast as I am, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.66,0:00:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear you laughing like\Nyou're numb to it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.74,0:00:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,While we're dashing together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.70,0:00:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we're never gonna fall, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.18,0:00:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole world may now be my enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.74,0:01:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Water's slow, but I ain't backing down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.28,0:01:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So long as I'm free, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.24,0:01:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thought I'd give it, come\Nround the current with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.22,0:01:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All in, wake up bright and early.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.78,0:01:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Making for the peak we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.64,0:01:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,All in, wake up bright and early.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.28,0:01:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Making for the peak we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.56,0:01:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Having fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.46,0:01:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this is the best\Nday ever! Hey, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.86,0:01:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I found some shaved ice right over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.70,0:01:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.61,0:01:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Papaya, fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.04,0:01:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never had shaved ice\Nbefore. That sounds so neat!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.14,0:01:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta go, Nami! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.78,0:01:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.40,0:02:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What if it melts?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.32,0:02:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,They've got a ton of flavors!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.64,0:02:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, how do I pick?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.82,0:02:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.28,0:02:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I want red bean soup flavor!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.92,0:02:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,How fast things!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.36,0:02:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no end to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.70,0:02:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you told me to go,\Nbut I can't leave you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.42,0:02:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You must!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.94,0:02:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke, I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.54,0:02:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Why won't you let me help you fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.78,0:02:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This matter is ours to settle, Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.56,0:02:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Step back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.16,0:03:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop wasting my time!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.34,0:03:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Just bring me Straw Hat, little baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.86,0:03:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.58,0:03:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Curts of a ring!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.64,0:03:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll end this! Sneak pole!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.66,0:03:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Scrolling Chouchou!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.14,0:03:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,FIRE!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.22,0:03:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,EXCEPT!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.68,0:03:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Burn to ashes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.68,0:03:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You baby scum!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.86,0:03:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.14,0:03:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,FIRE BREAK FORWARD!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.88,0:03:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm an Admiral of the Navy,\Nyou arrogant little dope!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.40,0:04:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I could rise to that position\Nwith such an obvious weakness?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.98,0:04:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Water gives life to humans and the\Nrest of the natural world as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.60,0:04:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.66,0:04:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.24,0:04:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Rhyzo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.66,0:04:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We need a new plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.10,0:04:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,His branches keep growing back!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.72,0:04:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.40,0:04:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Think, Cat, he must have some weakness!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.04,0:04:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe if we cut all of his\Nbranches at once somehow!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.50,0:04:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Rwahahahaha!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.96,0:05:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Wominosuke...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.16,0:05:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.46,0:05:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Rwahahahaha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.14,0:05:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hidden stairs?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.76,0:05:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.67,0:05:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems we've been sniffed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.92,0:05:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You were with the rest of the crew,\Nso naturally I got suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.68,0:05:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't act like I'm some kind of hyena.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.02,0:05:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Do watch your step.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.62,0:05:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a bit moldy down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.44,0:05:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I tried to hide this route from\NOrochi and Kaido, to no avail.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.82,0:05:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,As you know, their lead\Nperformer, Jack, is a fishman.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.12,0:05:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So despite my best efforts, they\Nfound the polyglyph in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.58,0:05:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What does being a fishman\Nhave to do with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.38,0:05:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.50,0:05:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a lot of stares.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.16,0:05:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How far down are you going to take us?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.00,0:05:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How far a few hundred\Nyears or so, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.68,0:06:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr Tang where was that light coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.50,0:06:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a glass window that lets you look
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.66,0:06:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,outside you can take a\Nquick peek if you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.70,0:06:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We're already at the bottom of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.48,0:06:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's cheating.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.76,0:06:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you see out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.14,0:06:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,A whole city underwater?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.42,0:06:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the land of Wano from\Nabout 800 years in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.28,0:06:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The original, you might say.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.76,0:06:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Eight hundred years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.62,0:07:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened back then?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.92,0:07:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,A fine question.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.26,0:07:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand the how and the\Nwhen, but the why is lost to time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.48,0:07:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The reason it's so well preserved is\Nbecause that's not actually seawater.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.70,0:07:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what I do know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.84,0:07:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The land of Wano was once located at a\Nbase of a huge mountain called Fujiyama.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.00,0:07:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,At one point, walls were created,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.08,0:07:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,enclosing the island, causing\Nrainfall to accumulate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.42,0:07:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,As time passed,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.90,0:07:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,the town became Unbelievable,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.16,0:07:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,so the people moved up the\Nmountain and built a new country,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.60,0:07:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,far above what you're seeing now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.96,0:07:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's the modern-day land of Juana?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.86,0:07:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.02,0:07:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's our destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.78,0:08:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,A road poneglyph.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.36,0:08:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the third one that\Nwe've found on our journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.50,0:08:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one more.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.24,0:08:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And we can make our way to Laugh Tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.84,0:08:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in a small cave at the foot of\NFujiyama, where the water doesn't reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.50,0:08:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't the only\Nthing buried down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.98,0:08:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It is said the ancient weapon\NPluton lies further beneath us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.70,0:08:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen the weapon myself and\NI'm afraid I can't show it to you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.02,0:08:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to retrieve\Nit the giant walls must
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.78,0:08:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,first be removed opening\Nthe borders of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.74,0:08:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only lowers our defenses but unleashes
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.58,0:08:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,the power of an ancient\Nweapon on the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.32,0:08:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,How frightful that is. Quite\Nthe risk, but that was.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.72,0:09:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Odin's wish why would he\Nwant that for this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.36,0:09:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I've told you everything that was
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.76,0:09:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,passed down to me I haven't a clue what.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.84,0:09:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Odin learned to cross the sea, so\Nhis intentions remain a mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.12,0:09:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Strupee!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.86,0:09:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Beppo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.44,0:09:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The shaved ice here is great!\NWhat? Where? I need it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.70,0:09:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I need it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.26,0:09:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave our country alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.34,0:09:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Babanuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.96,0:09:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're only human.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.78,0:09:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're no match for Mother Nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.20,0:10:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.32,0:10:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,in case you haven't caught on yet, the\Nreason I'm here is because Kaido is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.34,0:10:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He was a deterrent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.46,0:10:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if he ran this country into the\Nground, But he kept your enemies at bay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.98,0:10:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But lucky for you, we're not\Nplanning to invade right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.98,0:10:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So if you want me to go away,\Nthen bring me Straw Hat Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.60,0:10:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.51,0:10:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Call the Straw Hats now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.24,0:10:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be fine. They won't lose to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.78,0:10:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.20,0:10:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.40,0:10:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the same reason why\NI cannot ask you for aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.10,0:10:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You've spent your entire life\Nimprisoned on Onigashima.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.52,0:10:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But now, you can finally be free.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.54,0:10:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So I will send you off properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.96,0:10:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been depending on Luffy and his\Nfriends to see me through these trials.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.50,0:10:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But we who remain in this country\Nmust be able to stand on our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.48,0:11:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We cannot rely on those who are departing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.72,0:11:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our country to protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.64,0:11:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We must drive out its\Nenemies with our own power!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.28,0:11:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.32,0:11:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of here, you monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.20,0:11:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.11,0:11:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Why must you fail me now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.36,0:11:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta say, you're a pretty\Npathetic excuse for a dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.12,0:11:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had just about enough\Nof your stupid games.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.90,0:11:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave this country!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.30,0:11:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It finally worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.56,0:11:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the power of our lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.78,0:12:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He already wields that\Nattack like Kaido himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.82,0:12:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I said go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.66,0:12:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.57,0:12:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The water will never come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.06,0:12:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.10,0:12:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You little brats!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.56,0:12:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Drop them out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.94,0:12:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He's doing it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.52,0:12:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He has the full power of a dragon now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.52,0:12:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps, but his aim still\Nleaves much to be desired.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.62,0:12:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.34,0:12:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.84,0:12:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You trying to burn down the whole city?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.80,0:12:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.20,0:12:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.60,0:13:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You really think I'm scared\Nof some kind of wannabe?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.08,0:13:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Try that again and I'll\Nskewer you from head to tail!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.72,0:13:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't I move?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.02,0:13:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Conqueror's Haki...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.08,0:13:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.94,0:13:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it can't be the Red Hair\NPirates. Why are they here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.80,0:13:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on boss you can't just\Nbust your Haki out without
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.04,0:13:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,warning the new recruits can't\Nhandle it Yet I'm not saying
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.54,0:13:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,you have to be nice mr marine\Nbut these pirates fought hard
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.18,0:13:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,to change history Don't you\Nthink you'd be in a poor sport,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.46,0:13:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,stomping out flowers before\Nyou know what color they bloom?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.74,0:14:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Does this new era frighten you so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.60,0:14:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.68,0:14:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, I'm not trying to fight you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.74,0:14:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,At least not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.04,0:14:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, all right, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.90,0:14:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.56,0:14:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You did it, Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.32,0:14:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he's leaving!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.28,0:14:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You've defended the land of\NWano, just like you said!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.08,0:14:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I can protect this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.00,0:14:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I can protect my home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.92,0:14:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.28,0:14:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.26,0:14:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.32,0:14:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You did pretty good, Momo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.46,0:14:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.54,0:14:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't need us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.86,0:14:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I assume the rest of you felt\Nthat overwhelming Haki here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.46,0:14:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that sure was crazy, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.34,0:15:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Made me think of an old friend for a sec
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.82,0:15:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.30,0:15:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinobu Raizo
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.04,0:15:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,They just need fluids and some rest\Nthey'll be better soon I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.30,0:15:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That is a relief he was\Nright I hate to agree
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.48,0:15:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,with him but the whole world feared Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.44,0:15:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as he held Wano in his iron grip\Nno one would dare set foot on his shores.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.10,0:15:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me to my great\Nshame I was in cutie at
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.42,0:15:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,the time and wholly\Nignorant of your struggle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.18,0:15:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It all worked out fine\Nnobody blames you Karoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.76,0:15:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Momonosuke really put in the work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.68,0:15:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He saved us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.34,0:15:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, how is Otsuru?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.02,0:16:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been quite a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.22,0:16:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,She's hurt, but she will live.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.84,0:16:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,She was burned when Okobore Town set fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.64,0:16:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I failed to protect her too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.70,0:16:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are, Otsuru.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.64,0:16:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard King came back to see you. He did.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.66,0:16:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He had to hurry back to\Nthe Flower Capital though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.60,0:16:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You're from the capital, too, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.20,0:16:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Go be with your love. I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.70,0:16:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.86,0:16:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I've waited long enough already.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.38,0:16:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, even after 20 years, she's as\Nbeautiful as she was on our wedding day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.26,0:16:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.17,0:16:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough mushy stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.30,0:16:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You're becoming even\Nmore of a dog than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.96,0:16:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.04,0:16:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.92,0:16:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Rizal, you're awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.02,0:16:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there something you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.96,0:16:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Come closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.72,0:16:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.64,0:17:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I want a wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.56,0:17:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hounding after the ladies even now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.76,0:17:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.04,0:17:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bananas!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.88,0:17:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Carrot!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.32,0:17:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.18,0:17:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Duke Dogstorm and Master\NCatviper have some big news.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.48,0:17:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,They need you to come right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.72,0:17:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, finally showed up,\Nhuh? Hey, guys. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.26,0:17:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You got some news for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.08,0:17:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is everybody here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.86,0:17:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta keep us waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.88,0:18:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Carrot, we would like you, Kara,\Nto rule the Mokumo dukedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.66,0:18:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I get to roll!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.56,0:18:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.47,0:18:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Works for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.72,0:18:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.12,0:18:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.44,0:18:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I would be awful, I swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.72,0:18:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The thing is, the Catanine\Ndecided to stay in Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.56,0:18:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We're still samurai of the Kozuki clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.66,0:18:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,So it is our duty to keep\NLord Momonosuke safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.12,0:18:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You, Karoo, have traveled with Luffy,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.42,0:18:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,so you, Karoo, have a broader\Nview of the world than other Minx.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.62,0:18:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what the next\Ngeneration will need the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.28,0:18:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We believe in you, Karoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.16,0:18:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, like me, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.72,0:18:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,There's tons of Minx stronger than I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.76,0:18:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Should you ask them first?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.44,0:18:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No, they should not!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.48,0:18:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It is the duty of the strong\Nto protect our country!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.34,0:19:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I support their decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.26,0:19:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And I will support you, Tia, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.76,0:19:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Carrot, Yotia can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.92,0:19:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Pedro's will lives in your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.40,0:19:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Pedro's will?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.52,0:19:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We're counting on you, Carrot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.40,0:19:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow belongs to the young,\Nand so should Zoe, I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.82,0:19:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are grandfather?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.98,0:19:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.32,0:19:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Kozuki Odin was my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.76,0:19:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're alive and well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.96,0:19:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.42,0:19:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been so ashamed that\NI almost didn't tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.58,0:19:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't save Odin after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.00,0:19:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What's worse, I couldn't save the\Nland of Wano despite being Shogun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.58,0:20:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I failed you. Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.08,0:20:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I have always wanted to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.38,0:20:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Me as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.14,0:20:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're too kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.58,0:20:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still shocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.02,0:20:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You look just like Odin did\Nat your age, Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.36,0:20:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm shocked as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.08,0:20:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But more than anything,\NI'm happy to have a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.26,0:20:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You cannot know what that means\Nto us after our parents' loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.80,0:20:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So please don't apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.50,0:20:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what happened, we're so\Nglad to have you with us today.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.92,0:20:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart leapt into my throat\Nto think that he was among us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.90,0:20:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I never dared to dream such a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.10,0:20:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Tsukiyaki is alive and well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.16,0:20:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,His disguise was truly flawless.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.74,0:20:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd figured out my\Nsecret, but what was I to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.60,0:20:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You did wear a Tang mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.54,0:21:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that draws attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.36,0:21:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We certainly didn't think that\Nyou were an average swordsmith.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.38,0:21:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We feigned ignorance out of\Nrespect, but we weren't fooled.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.16,0:21:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Master Kaido?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.18,0:21:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.02,0:21:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.08,0:21:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I put you through so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.22,0:21:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I can tell you about the\Nland of Wano's history.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.14,0:21:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I stayed alive all these\Nyears so I could do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.18,0:21:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's all I'm good for anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.48,0:21:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So I beg you, let me cede the throne\Nand let the nation think I'm dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.58,0:21:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a new era.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.38,0:21:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It is yours to create.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.44,0:21:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Knowing that you are alive is enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.78,0:21:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That gives us strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.76,0:21:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're telling me Pluton\Nis buried down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.40,0:21:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.31,0:21:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't get to see it\Nin person, mind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.56,0:21:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But it is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.06,0:21:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I honestly wasn't even sure if it existed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.38,0:22:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that the big ship Franky burned\Nthe blueprints for? Correct an
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.44,0:22:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,ancient weapon with the name of\Na god they said would you want to
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.92,0:22:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,have it Luffy the weapon no thanks\Ni'm good that's no surprise but
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.34,0:22:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,after Odin traveled the seas he\Nwanted to unleash it i wonder why
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.88,0:22:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.79,0:22:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I was in danger?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.84,0:22:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Danger, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.46,0:22:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose a mature woman like me\Nmight strike you right in the heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.94,0:22:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a joke? Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.10,0:22:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Who am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.50,0:22:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't recognize me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.52,0:22:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose I did waste away a\Nbit after that last battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.86,0:22:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's me, Shinobu.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.72,0:22:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.46,0:22:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.86,0:22:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I love it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.78,0:22:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so lovely. It shocked\Nme right down to my bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.30,0:22:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Although, I suppose bones are all I got.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.64,0:22:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Bro, big bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.84,0:23:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess what?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.14,0:23:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinobu's going to teach\Nme to be a real Kunoichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.74,0:23:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get real strong, so next time I see\Nyou, you've got to let me join your crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.80,0:23:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Heck yeah, we could use a ninja.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.98,0:23:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So train hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.02,0:23:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You bet I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.54,0:23:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be a bewitching\NKunoichi in no time, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.58,0:23:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ning, ning.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.94,0:23:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Otama, you are so precious.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.58,0:23:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm going to miss you most of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.94,0:23:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now there's a shocker.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.10,0:23:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Pluton is in the land of Wano?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.64,0:23:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,First Poseidon, and now this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.28,0:23:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I know a certain someone who's going\Nto be very interested in this news.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.94,0:24:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Shogun!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.85,0:24:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.42,0:24:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The plans are complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.46,0:24:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Reconstruction can begin shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.72,0:24:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.78,0:24:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I've included cost estimates\Nfor each region as well. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.78,0:24:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent work.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.56,0:24:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Shogun, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.64,0:24:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We have proposals to repurpose\Nthe weapons factories.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.64,0:24:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,They're just waiting for your approval.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.62,0:24:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.16,0:24:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.42,0:24:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you give me your opinion on the\Nreservoir when you have the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.58,0:24:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We should speak with\Nall the daimyo as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.82,0:24:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's schedule a meeting\Nin the near future.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.98,0:24:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.04,0:24:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Shogun!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.20,0:24:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.08,0:24:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to learn a few sword techniques.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.38,0:25:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think you could teach me? Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.20,0:25:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.14,0:25:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Onami!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.76,0:25:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.90,0:25:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanchi?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.81,0:25:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper him on? Robin? Franky? Brook?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.12,0:25:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you there, Jinbe?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.12,0:25:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamato?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.03,0:25:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did everyone go? Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.08,0:25:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiyori, have you seen Luffy and his crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.02,0:25:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,They said their farewells.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.68,0:25:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,They're leaving the land of Wano now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.70,0:25:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Sad, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.64,0:25:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Said their farewells?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.50,0:25:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,They didn't say a word to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.96,0:25:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are, Lord Momonosuke! Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.70,0:25:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.76,0:25:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this about Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.40,0:25:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I just found out that he's departing!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.54,0:26:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You too?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.45,0:26:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This is so cruel!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.90,0:26:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I asked all the retainers, and the Straw\NHat spoke to every one of them but me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.24,0:26:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would they exclude us when\Nwe've known them the longest?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.04,0:26:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We're leaving today. You don't get\Nto huh, what does that mean? Don't
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.16,0:26:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,make it weird all right We can't\Nall sail off at the same time
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.06,0:26:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Our alliance is over. Remember\Nwe're enemies now. We're leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.78,0:26:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,today because that's what we decided\Non so did we the hell Trafalgar
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.44,0:26:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my day. Pick\Nanother. Yeah, no thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.50,0:26:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You can change your own damn schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.54,0:26:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm not changing mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.58,0:26:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This is nothing but a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.00,0:26:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine. How's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.10,0:26:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll go in different directions.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.52,0:26:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The log poe's locked onto\Nthree different islands.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.34,0:27:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,One is northeast, one's\Neast, and one's southeast.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.76,0:27:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Take your pick.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.00,0:27:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The metal hoist.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.72,0:27:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.78,0:27:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your problem now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.66,0:27:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Heading northeast gets you\Nthe farthest ahead, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.72,0:27:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,If you had half a brain cell\Nbetween you two, you'd get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.12,0:27:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The middle one?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.98,0:27:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Dumbasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.28,0:27:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care what you do,\Nbecause I'm heading off now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.86,0:27:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Have fun bickering.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.62,0:27:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Straw Hat, let's draw for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.98,0:27:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,When it goes east, lose it goes southeast.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.24,0:27:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I picked this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.66,0:27:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.57,0:27:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I got east.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.74,0:27:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I messed up the draw!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.08,0:27:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.56,0:27:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Just help us load the sunny!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.80,0:27:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be dangerous wherever we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.20,0:27:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.62,0:27:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm an emperor of the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.56,0:27:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I lose it then? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.72,0:27:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're pissing me off!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.78,0:28:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, there's one emperor\Neven lamer than you!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.92,0:28:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you believe this?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.16,0:28:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Buggy the Genius Jester.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.48,0:28:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.22,0:28:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Crocodile and Hawkeye are there too.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.64,0:28:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.55,0:28:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,They're making you look\Nlike they work for Buggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.76,0:28:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.67,0:28:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.94,0:28:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hawkeye wouldn't work for that clown.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.64,0:28:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If he really has those two under\Nhis control, then I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.66,0:28:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That alone would make\Nhim emperor material.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.52,0:28:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucky's just a dumbass.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.32,0:28:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd he pull this off?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.82,0:28:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't tell you, but the new company\Nhe's running is called Cross Guild,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.08,0:28:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,and they've started putting bounties\Non the heads of famous marines.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.24,0:28:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The Navy was always a hunter before,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.56,0:29:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,but now anyone in the world can come\Nafter them just like us pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.00,0:29:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems that while we were\Non our little getaway in Wind,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.70,0:29:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,the entire world turned on its head.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.08,0:29:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, you know where\Nyou're going, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.72,0:29:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Good thing we're headed in different\Ndirections, because we're enemies from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.38,0:29:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a parting gift?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.10,0:29:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.48,0:29:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a copy of a road poneglyph.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.82,0:29:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Poneglyph, you guys have\Nthe right to this as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.90,0:29:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheating would take the fun out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.54,0:29:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So Kaido did have one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.84,0:29:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just like the thing we swiped\Nfrom one of Big Mom's generals.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.60,0:29:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in the endgame, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.26,0:29:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta get serious about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.78,0:29:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what we gotta do if we\Nwanna fight for the One Piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.32,0:29:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Find the man with the burn scar, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.46,0:29:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's step one.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.00,0:29:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have any leads, though. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.02,0:29:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.93,0:29:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What burn scar?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.85,0:30:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.50,0:30:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.92,0:30:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I get a head start, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.52,0:30:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, just tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.00,0:30:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.91,0:30:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.48,0:30:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.14,0:30:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not hiding from me, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.38,0:30:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.96,0:30:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.76,0:30:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.40,0:30:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is here?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.20,0:30:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,On top of the roof, it would seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.54,0:30:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.58,0:30:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I've made up my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.78,0:30:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, this is it. I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.66,0:30:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.57,0:30:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to live like Kozuki Oden!
